// Frame Job's own strengths (GR-11, owner choice 6; tuned by amending it): a
// push at the rim is the whole of `lookHueChroma`; lift +1 takes black to
// 25 %, gain ±1 is white ×1.5 / ×0.5, gamma +1 is the exponent ½.
